{"schema_version":3,"catalogue_version":1,"id":"bco:20-9","provision":"BCO 20-9","book":"bco","book_name":"Book of Church Order","abbreviation":"BCO","reference":"20-9","title":"Section 20-9","supplementary":false,"canonical_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/provisions/bco/20-9/","reader_url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-constitution-reader/#bco/20-9","current_text":{"html":"<p>When a pastor desires to accept a call to another Presbytery, he must be examined and approved by the Presbytery for the pastorate to which he is being called, and must be released for transfer by his present Presbytery from his pastorate.</p>","text":"When a pastor desires to accept a call to another Presbytery, he must be examined and approved by the Presbytery for the pastorate to which he is being called, and must be released for transfer by his present Presbytery from his pastorate."},"source":{"name":"PCA Constitution Reader","revision":"a37d71a35e8f9c0167937b7d42b075812156fb6a","edition":"Current Reader text","files":{"bco.js":"c88e552545b73fd9690de620b237895b7ea52a94bed8e95690c116bf76be8ae5","wcf.js":"1ebf9e54223f7fe4e728a3e640c833a435af825d74b5ef3d4b04687685538a0d","wlc.js":"f6977e761ea4ccc93b07fcacfd0391890cb05b42f4317d807fa293c078d9b051","wsc.js":"dd775417f7ef21e3283bacad5e6ef193c41d64d03bd5a2e8fb934ccca8cb8e53","rao.js":"49808bbb0e95abdc3b07506c87dde0d62d087851e869b49c0f1f2424986450ec"}},"input_fingerprint":"613a69259d78b86fb70a893f9e1757ec3e9bad7c9b7578dfb01c4796d6a9b4fc","assessment_fingerprint":"517b100d2e9006e313ab6d84d4f0f31593b77832f395383ba2227779470cd034","assessment_summary":{"status":"stale","file":"index/provision_link_adjudications.jsonl","total":11481,"expected":12405,"applied":0,"stale":11481,"unmatched":0,"unassessed":12405},"parent_id":"bco:20","children":[],"coverage":{"relationships":"indexed_records","recommendations":{"status":"incomplete","note":"Recommendation and study papers are not comprehensively indexed by provision."},"history":"partial"},"relationship_count":12,"relationships":[{"id":"bco:20-9--case:cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md","record_id":"case:cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md","type":"Judicial case","title":"Gonzales v. Great Lakes Presbytery","year":2012,"disposition":"sustained","authority_weight":"high","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.html","raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md","evidence_basis":"direct_text","relevance_status":"unreviewed","occurrences":[{"id":"bco:20-9--case:cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md:occ-6a7929121494","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.html","repository_path":"cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md","locator":{"fragment":null,"line":143},"excerpt":"I believe this Presbytery made a clear error of judgment by essentially making a preemptive decision on a matter that was not yet before them. There was no BCO 20-9 motion.","sources":["case_markdown_text","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_as","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_current","judicial_cases.jsonl:bco_provisions"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md"},{"id":"bco:20-9--case:cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md:occ-adcb1b23c249","url":"https://raymond-rishty.github.io/pca-ga/cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.html","repository_path":"cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md","locator":{"fragment":null,"line":147},"excerpt":"…not amendable or rescindable, per Robert's). A Presbytery's decision on a BCO 20-9 motion is not made ahead of time (unless it's indirectly the result of a disciplinary censure). While the Presbytery did not directly violate any provision of the BCO and…","sources":["case_markdown_text","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_as","cases.jsonl:bco_cited_current","judicial_cases.jsonl:bco_provisions"],"raw_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/raymond-rishty/pca-ga/main/cases/ga40_2012__2010-28.md"}],"reference_presentation":{"group":"review","label":null},"metadata":{"topics":["B